{"nodes": [{"id": "docs_tactics_photos_a8f681aa85f7ca1c523ccc79820cd4d1", "label": "停滞检测参数分析笔记 (Stall Detection Parameter Analysis Notes)", "file_type": "image", "source_file": "docs/Tactics/photos/a8f681aa85f7ca1c523ccc79820cd4d1.png", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "description": "截图: 关于投放精校停滞检测参数调优的分析笔记(中文)。内容包含: 1) 参数建议表 (stall_threshold 25->45->55, stall_stable_band 10->18, stall_duration 5->3.5, 理由: tolerance=35 需 20px 风噪余量, 风大帧间跳动常达 15px; 5s 太长 3.5s 够判断真停滞); 2) 45/10/5 未触发原因: 帧序列 43/50/38/52/29/35/47px 反复穿越 45px 阈值, threshold 时长与 stable_band 两把锁被风吹反复重置, 从未攒够时长; 3) 关键认知: 停滞检测是兜底, 真正该通的路径是 is_precise() -> final_brake -> speed 0.15 -> release -> ready -> 投放; 4) 风险: stall_threshold 设太低(靠近 tolerance)导致投放精度变差, 55 给 tolerance(35) 留 20px 缓冲区并强制放行。"}, {"id": "docs_tactics_photos_a8f681aa85f7ca1c523ccc79820cd4d1_stall_param_tuning", "label": "停滞检测参数调优 (Stall Detection Parameter Tuning)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/Tactics/photos/a8f681aa85f7ca1c523ccc79820cd4d1.png", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "tolerance 已改为 35, 风大时 pixel_error 抖动剧烈, 需 20px 风噪余量 (风大帧间跳动常达 15px), 故 stall_threshold 建议 55 而非 45; stall_stable_band 10 太容易被帧间跳动打破, 建议 18; stall_duration 5s 太长, 3.5s 足够判断真停滞。stall_threshold 若设得太低(靠近 tolerance)会导致投放精度变差; 55 给 tolerance(35) 留了 20px 缓冲区, 支持强制放行。"}, {"id": "docs_tactics_photos_a8f681aa85f7ca1c523ccc79820cd4d1_nontrigger_analysis", "label": "45/10/5 停滞检测未触发原因分析 (Why 45/10/5 Stall Detection Did Not Trigger)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/Tactics/photos/a8f681aa85f7ca1c523ccc79820cd4d1.png", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "看日志实际序列: 帧1 43px(<45), 帧2 50px(>45 退出停滞), 帧3 38px(<45), 帧4 52px(>45 退出), 帧5 29px(<45), 帧6 35px 波动, 帧7 47px(>45 退出)。pixel_error 在 45px 阈值两侧反复穿越: threshold 时长太容易被风一吹就越界, stable_band=10 也太容易被帧间跳动打破, 两把锁(停滞计时 + 稳定带宽)反复重置, 从来没攒够判定秒数。"}, {"id": "docs_tactics_photos_a8f681aa85f7ca1c523ccc79820cd4d1_stall_fallback_insight", "label": "停滞检测是兜底 (Stall Detection Is a Fallback)", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/Tactics/photos/a8f681aa85f7ca1c523ccc79820cd4d1.png", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "关键认知: 停滞检测是兜底, 真正该通的路径是 is_precise() -> final_brake -> speed 0.15 -> release -> ready -> 投放。正常路径通了之后停滞检测大概率不再需要, 只在极端情况下才介入(如收敛到 30PX 持续 5 帧)。"}], "edges": [{"source": "docs_tactics_photos_a8f681aa85f7ca1c523ccc79820cd4d1", "target": "docs_tactics_photos_a8f681aa85f7ca1c523ccc79820cd4d1_stall_param_tuning", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/Tactics/photos/a8f681aa85f7ca1c523ccc79820cd4d1.png", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_tactics_photos_a8f681aa85f7ca1c523ccc79820cd4d1", "target": "docs_tactics_photos_a8f681aa85f7ca1c523ccc79820cd4d1_nontrigger_analysis", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/Tactics/photos/a8f681aa85f7ca1c523ccc79820cd4d1.png", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_tactics_photos_a8f681aa85f7ca1c523ccc79820cd4d1", "target": "docs_tactics_photos_a8f681aa85f7ca1c523ccc79820cd4d1_stall_fallback_insight", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/Tactics/photos/a8f681aa85f7ca1c523ccc79820cd4d1.png", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_tactics_photos_a8f681aa85f7ca1c523ccc79820cd4d1_nontrigger_analysis", "target": "docs_tactics_photos_a8f681aa85f7ca1c523ccc79820cd4d1_stall_param_tuning", "relation": "rationale_for", "confidence": "INFERRED", "confidence_score": 0.95, "source_file": "docs/Tactics/photos/a8f681aa85f7ca1c523ccc79820cd4d1.png", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_tactics_photos_a8f681aa85f7ca1c523ccc79820cd4d1_nontrigger_analysis", "target": "docs_tactics_photos_a8f681aa85f7ca1c523ccc79820cd4d1_stall_fallback_insight", "relation": "conceptually_related_to", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/Tactics/photos/a8f681aa85f7ca1c523ccc79820cd4d1.png", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_tactics_photos_a8f681aa85f7ca1c523ccc79820cd4d1_stall_fallback_insight", "target": "docs_tactics_photos_a8f681aa85f7ca1c523ccc79820cd4d1_stall_param_tuning", "relation": "conceptually_related_to", "confidence": "INFERRED", "confidence_score": 0.85, "source_file": "docs/Tactics/photos/a8f681aa85f7ca1c523ccc79820cd4d1.png", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_tactics_photos_a8f681aa85f7ca1c523ccc79820cd4d1_stall_fallback_insight", "target": "src_drone_mission_drone_mission_precision_align_controller_precisionaligncontroller_is_precise", "relation": "references", "confidence": "INFERRED", "confidence_score": 0.95, "source_file": "docs/Tactics/photos/a8f681aa85f7ca1c523ccc79820cd4d1.png", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_tactics_photos_a8f681aa85f7ca1c523ccc79820cd4d1_stall_param_tuning", "target": "src_drone_mission_drone_mission_states_state_drop_dropstate_execute_descend", "relation": "references", "confidence": "INFERRED", "confidence_score": 0.85, "source_file": "docs/Tactics/photos/a8f681aa85f7ca1c523ccc79820cd4d1.png", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_tactics_photos_a8f681aa85f7ca1c523ccc79820cd4d1", "target": "docs_tactics_drop_stall_analysis", "relation": "conceptually_related_to", "confidence": "INFERRED", "confidence_score": 0.75, "source_file": "docs/Tactics/photos/a8f681aa85f7ca1c523ccc79820cd4d1.png", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}], "hyperedges": [{"id": "stall_detection_strategy_analysis", "label": "停滞检测策略分析 (Stall Detection Strategy Analysis)", "nodes": ["docs_tactics_photos_a8f681aa85f7ca1c523ccc79820cd4d1_stall_param_tuning", "docs_tactics_photos_a8f681aa85f7ca1c523ccc79820cd4d1_nontrigger_analysis", "docs_tactics_photos_a8f681aa85f7ca1c523ccc79820cd4d1_stall_fallback_insight"], "relation": "participate_in", "confidence": "INFERRED", "confidence_score": 0.85, "source_file": "docs/Tactics/photos/a8f681aa85f7ca1c523ccc79820cd4d1.png"}]}